  "prefLabel": "Agr 503.15 Information About Farm Land and Real Estate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 503.15 Information About Farm Land and Real Estate. The information submitted about farm land and real estate offered for sale shall be on a completed department-issued form:\n\n(a) Bearing the notarized signature of the property owner; and\n\n(b) Including the following:\n\n(1) A description of the property to be advertised; and\n\n(2) A statement of certification that:\n\na. The signer is not a real estate agent or real estate broker; and\n\nb. The signer is the present legal owner of the property described.\n\nSource. #9616, eff 12-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr500.html"
}
